The classic solitaire and four-prong settings leave the most budget for the stone. The twisted halo at $2,250 cuts into your stone budget significantly at a $5K total — you're left with $2,750 for the stone, which limits you to a 1ct natural at good grades or a lab stone. If you want the halo look at a $5K total, go lab. If you want natural, increase your total first.

