## Natural Radiant Cut Ring Prices

Natural GIA-certified radiant cuts in current certified market inventory start at [around $2,318 for a 1ct G-VS2 Ideal](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). The radiant cut prices less than an oval or round brilliant at the same carat weight because demand is lower. That is a real advantage for buyers who want a less-common shape.

[![Radiant cut engagement ring yellow gold solitaire on display](/images/radiant-cut-diamond-ring-yellow-gold-solitaire.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?ShapeID=Radiant&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

VS2 clarity is the floor for a radiant cut — not VS1, like the emerald cut. The 70 brilliant-style facets scatter light and hide inclusions that a step-cut would expose. A GIA-graded VS2 in a radiant cut will look eye-clean at arm's length. You can save hundreds by choosing VS2 over VS1 without any visible difference.

