## Lab Radiant Cut Engagement Ring: The Size Argument

Lab-grown radiant cuts give you the 70-facet fire of a natural radiant at a fraction of the cost. At 2ct, a lab radiant paired with a good setting is the best-value engagement ring in the market right now.

[![Radiant cut diamond engagement ring yellow gold on model hand](/images/radiant-cut-engagement-ring-yellow-gold-on-hand.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?ShapeID=Radiant&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

A 2ct lab radiant has the same physical dimensions as a 2ct natural radiant. Same L/W ratio, same face-up size, same 70 facets, same fire. A GIA or IGI-certified lab radiant is chemically, optically, and physically identical to a natural radiant. The only difference is origin and price.

